|{k:Delicate Linen Thread|Delicate linen thread}|{p:Fay Spring}|{z:Grauberg (S)} (F-6)|{k:Enchanted Linen Thread|Enchanted linen thread}
|{k:Delicate Cotton Thread|Delicate cotton thread}|{p:Lake Tepokalipuka}|{z:East Sarutabaruta} (F-9)|{k:Enchanted Cotton thread|Enchanted cotton thread}

* Once you have all three key items, return to Ponono for a cutscene and your reward.
